  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "體育—防身術",
    "sub_ename": "SELF-DEFENSE",
    "describe_ch": " 以柔道為基礎架構的招式來做練習。透過柔道學習使學員藉由護身倒法、關節技及摔技了解到如何保護自己。透過兩人相對的肢體攻防練習過程使關節技、摔技的技能熟練，進而讓身體的反射本能加快，對於突如其來肢體衝擊達到防身的目的。",
    "describe_eh": "Doing exercises based on judo.Through learning judo to know how to protect ourselves by Ukemi, Kansetsu waza and Nage waza.\r\n          Improving Kansetsu waza and Nage waza through the offensive and defensive practicing of two members’ psychical training, therefore it made the body reflective instinct improved. It can achieve self-defense effect against sudden physical conflicts.\r\n",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 1.0
  },
